                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts1400" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts1411">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>"This husband of mine is good", says she. She said that he told her "I am happy as long as you are healthy. I do not need any children."</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
